---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const title = 'Terms of Service — SubZaps';
const description = 'SubZaps Terms of Service. Understand your rights, service limitations, 7-day refund policy, and billing rules.';
const lastUpdated = 'September 12, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout {title} {description}>
	<Nav />
	<main class="legal-page">
		<div class="legal-container">
			<header class="legal-header">
				<span class="legal-badge">Terms & Conditions</span>
				<h1>Terms of Service</h1>
				<p class="legal-updated">Last Updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
			</header>

			<article class="legal-content">
				<section>
					<h2>1. Agreement to Terms</h2>
					<p>
						These Terms of Service ("Terms") constitute a legally binding agreement between you ("User", "you", or "your") and <strong>SubZaps</strong> ("SubZaps", "we", "us", or "our"), governing your access to and use of the SubZaps website, web application, tools, and subscription management services located at <code>subzaps.com</code>.
					</p>
					<p>
						By creating an account, connecting an inbox, or purchasing a SubZaps subscription, you signify your full acceptance of these Terms. If you do not agree with any part of these Terms, you must not access or use our services.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2>2. Service Description & Scope</h2>
					<p>
						SubZaps provides automated subscription identification, renewal monitoring, reminder alerts, and cancellation guidance. We assist consumers in uncovering recurring digital charges, tracking renewal schedules, and providing streamlined step-by-step instructions or automated assistance to cancel unwanted subscriptions.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2>3. Cancellation Disclaimer & No Guarantee of Success</h2>
					<div class="legal-highlight">
						<strong>Important Service Limitation:</strong>
						<p>
							SubZaps makes every reasonable effort to provide accurate, up-to-date cancellation steps and automated cancellation requests. However, third-party merchants and subscription providers (e.g., gym chains, streaming services, software providers) frequently change their cancellation policies, technical interfaces, and legal terms without notice.
						</p>
					</div>
					<p>
						Consequently, <strong>SubZaps cannot and does not guarantee that every cancellation attempt will be honored or processed immediately by the third-party provider</strong>.
					</p>
					<ul>
						<li>
							<strong>User Responsibility:</strong> You retain ultimate responsibility for verifying with your third-party service provider or financial institution that a subscription has been terminated and that recurring charges have ceased.
						</li>
						<li>
							<strong>No Authorization to Incur Debt:</strong> SubZaps is not a party to your contracts with third-party service providers. You remain liable for any contractual obligations, early termination fees, or unpaid balances owed directly to third-party merchants.
						</li>
					</ul>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2>4. Subscriptions, Billing & Recurring Charges</h2>
					<p>
						SubZaps offers both Free tiers and paid memberships (including <strong>SubZaps Pro</strong> and <strong>SubZaps Family</strong>).
					</p>
					<ul>
						<li>
							<strong>Billing Frequency:</strong> Paid memberships are billed on a recurring periodic basis (monthly or annually) according to the billing cycle selected at the time of purchase.
						</li>
						<li>
							<strong>Payment Processor:</strong> Payments are processed securely via Stripe. By subscribing, you authorize SubZaps and Stripe to store your payment credential token and charge recurring subscription fees until you cancel.
						</li>
						<li>
							<strong>Price Adjustments:</strong> We reserve the right to modify membership pricing upon at least 30 days prior notice sent to your registered email address.
						</li>
					</ul>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2>5. 7-Day Money-Back Guarantee & Refund Policy</h2>
					<p>
						We believe strongly in the value of SubZaps. If you purchase SubZaps Pro or SubZaps Family and are not completely satisfied with our service, you are entitled to a full refund subject to the following terms:
					</p>
					<ul>
						<li>
							<strong>7-Day Window:</strong> You must request your refund within <strong>seven (7) calendar days</strong> of your initial upgrade or renewal charge.
						</li>
						<li>
							<strong>No Questions Asked:</strong> Simply email <a href="mailto:support@subzaps.com">support@subzaps.com</a> or <a href="mailto:billing@subzaps.com">billing@subzaps.com</a> with your account email address. We will process your 100% refund immediately via Stripe.
						</li>
						<li>
							<strong>Processing Time:</strong> Refunds typically appear on your original payment card statement within 3 to 7 business days depending on your bank.
						</li>
					</ul>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2>6. User Account & Security Responsibilities</h2>
					<p>
						You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account credentials, passwords, and connected email integrations. You agree to immediately notify SubZaps of any unauthorized use or suspected security breach at <a href="mailto:security@subzaps.com">security@subzaps.com</a>.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2>7. Cancellation of SubZaps Membership</h2>
					<p>
						You may cancel your SubZaps Pro or Family membership at any time with zero penalty:
					</p>
					<ul>
						<li>Navigate to <a href="/account">Account Settings</a> → Subscription Plan → "Downgrade to Free".</li>
						<li>Upon cancellation, your Pro features remain fully accessible until the conclusion of your current paid billing period.</li>
						<li>You will not be billed again unless you reactivate your membership.</li>
					</ul>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2>8. Limitation of Liability</h2>
					<p>
						To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, in no event shall SubZaps, its founders, directors, employees, or partners be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages, including loss of profits, data, goodwill, or financial losses resulting from third-party recurring charges, bank overdraft fees, or failed cancellations.
					</p>
					<p>
						Our aggregate liability for any claims under these Terms is strictly limited to the amount paid by you to SubZaps during the twelve (12) months preceding the event giving rise to the claim.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2>9. Contact Us</h2>
					<p>
						If you have any questions regarding these Terms of Service or billing inquiries, please contact our support team:
					</p>
					<div class="legal-contact-card">
						<p><strong>SubZaps Customer Support & Legal</strong></p>
						<p>Email: <a href="mailto:support@subzaps.com">support@subzaps.com</a></p>
						<p>Billing: <a href="mailto:billing@subzaps.com">billing@subzaps.com</a></p>
						<p>Website: <a href="https://subzaps.com">https://subzaps.com</a></p>
					</div>
				</section>
			</article>
		</div>
	</main>
	<Footer />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.legal-page {
		min-height: 100svh;
		padding: 4rem 1.5rem 6rem;
		background: #050505;
		color: #ccc;
		font-family: var(--font-body);
	}

	.legal-container {
		max-width: 48rem;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.legal-header {
		margin-bottom: 3rem;
		padding-bottom: 2rem;
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
	}

	.legal-badge {
		display: inline-block;
		padding: 0.25rem 0.65rem;
		border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
		background: rgba(0, 255, 136, 0.1);
		color: var(--color-accent);
		border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 136, 0.25);
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 0.74rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.legal-header h1 {
		margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 2.75rem);
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: -0.04em;
		color: #fff;
	}

	.legal-updated {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 0.88rem;
		color: var(--color-muted);
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
	}

	.legal-content section {
		margin-bottom: 2.75rem;
	}

	.legal-content h2 {
		margin: 0 0 1rem;
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: 1.35rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
		color: #fff;
	}

	.legal-content p {
		margin: 0 0 1rem;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		line-height: 1.65;
		color: #bbb;
	}

	.legal-content strong {
		color: #fff;
	}

	.legal-content ul {
		margin: 0 0 1.25rem 1.25rem;
		padding: 0;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.5rem;
	}

	.legal-content li {
		font-size: 0.92rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
		color: #bbb;
	}

	.legal-content a {
		color: var(--color-accent);
		text-decoration: underline;
		text-underline-offset: 3px;
	}

	.legal-content code {
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 0.84rem;
		background: #121212;
		border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
		padding: 0.15rem 0.45rem;
		border-radius: 4px;
		color: #00ff88;
	}

	.legal-highlight {
		padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
		background: rgba(255, 68, 68, 0.06);
		border: 1px solid rgba(255, 68, 68, 0.25);
		border-radius: var(--radius-card);
		margin: 1.25rem 0;
	}

	.legal-highlight strong {
		color: #ff7777;
		display: block;
		margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
	}

	.legal-highlight p {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}

	.legal-contact-card {
		padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
		background: #0c0c0c;
		border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
		border-radius: var(--radius-card);
		margin-top: 1rem;
	}

	.legal-contact-card p {
		margin: 0 0 0.35rem;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}

	.legal-contact-card p:last-child {
		margin: 0;
	}
</style>
